3. That, post attestation of mutation No.345 (Sehti Kasht), the revenue records viz Jamabandi 1965-66 reveals that land in question measuring 18-Kanals under survey No.654 (which included in mutation No.345- Sehti Kasht attested on 25.06.1963 in favour of Ghulam Qadir S/o Asad Sheikh) is recorded as Gair Mumkin Darya (Maqbooza Sarkar) and there is no entry in favour of Ghulam Qadir S/o Asad Sheikh as occupant in said Jamabandi in said survey number.
4. That, with respect to land measuring 06K 04M under survey No.969/734/654 shown as Abi Soem in the name of Mohammad Yousuf S/o Mohammad Akbar(Tenant at Will) Bakasht Ghulam Qadir S/o Asad Sheikh as shown in Jamabandi 1965-66, no entry indicating tenancy rights of said Ghulam Qadir over said 06K 04M (Abi Soem) has been carried forward in the prospective records viz;
Jamabandi 1969-70, Girdawari Rabi- 1971 and Girdawari Kharief-1982 which clearly indicates that land measuring 06K 04M was not under the cultivation of said Ghulam Qadir S/o Asad Sheikh prior to the attestation of mutation 1000 (LB-6) and 1001 (432-C) and the said land of 6K 4M under survey No. 724/654 stands mutated in favour of Mohammad Yousuf S/o Akbar as Tenant-at-will vide mutation of 320 (LB-6).
